            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"what-to-report-back\">What To Report Back</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Please report one of:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>semantic works</code>: mapped is audibly between baseline and oracle in the desired way.</li>\n<li><code>semantic weak</code>: mapped is valid audio but barely changes the result.</li>\n<li><code>semantic harmful</code>: mapped causes artifacts, identity loss, or worse conversion.</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Useful notes: pair numbers where mapped improves, pair numbers where mapped fails, and whether the difference sounds like identity, singing mode, loudness, breathiness, or F0/prosody.</span></span>"
